## 2. Slashcommands
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/2/explain
parent: Introduction/2
type: text/markdown

Type `/` to access formatting and component insertion options quickly without leaving the keyboard. 

<details>
<summary><strong>Expand for common slashcommands:</strong></summary>

- `/date` - Insert an interactive date picker link.
- `/anchor` - Apply a structured template to the node.
- `/todo` - Insert a markdown checkbox.
- `/calc` - Insert an inline calculator macro.
- `/table` - Insert an AutoTable macro.

</details>
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/2/demo
parent: Introduction/2
stream-list: Introduction/2/demo/1
type: text/markdown

#### Demonstration:
**Double-click the child node below to edit it**, then type a character (like `n` or `d`) right after the slash to see the autocomplete menu!
