## 3. Easy Todo with integrated calendar
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/3/explain
parent: Introduction/3
type: text/markdown

Keep track of tasks with simple `[ ]` markdown. Use inline calendar pages to mark due dates. 

**Double-click any node to edit it**, and try typing `/date` or clicking the calendar icon in the sidebar toolbar!
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/3/demo
parent: Introduction/3
type: text/markdown

#### Demonstration:
* **Double-click this node to edit**, then change `[ ]` to `[x]`:
* [ ] Example Todo Item
* [x] Completed Todo Item
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/3/code
parent: Introduction/3
type: text/markdown

```markdown
#### Demonstration:
* **Double-click this node to edit**, then change `[ ]` to `[x]`:
* [ ] Example Todo Item
* [x] Completed Todo Item
```
