## 4. Markdown and KaTeX Formatting
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/4/explain
parent: Introduction/4
type: text/markdown

Full support for standard `**markdown**` and math equations with `$$KaTeX$$`.
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/4/demo
parent: Introduction/4
type: text/markdown

#### Demonstration:
**Double-click this node to edit it** and try changing the formatting! Look at this **bold** and *italic* text, or this equation:

$$ E = mc^2 $$
⁂⁂⁂
