## 8. Sane print defaults
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/8/explain
parent: Introduction/8
type: text/markdown

Lithic is optimized to look great when printed or exported to PDF natively through your browser. 

You can **double-click** elements to ensure everything is perfect, then print!
