## 10. Syntax highlighting
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/10/explain
parent: Introduction/10
type: text/markdown

Automatic code highlighting for popular languages perfectly styled out-of-the-box. 

**Double-click the code snippet** below to edit the code.
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/10/demo
parent: Introduction/10
type: text/markdown

#### Demonstration:
**Double-click here to edit this snippet!**
```javascript
function sayHello() {
  console.log("Hello world!");
}
```
