## 12. Infinite portability and customization
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/12/explain
parent: Introduction/12
type: text/markdown

Being built on a self-contained architecture means Lithic is a single HTML file you can take anywhere, hack, and customize to your heart's content.
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/12/demo
parent: Introduction/12
type: text/markdown

#### Demonstration:
You can save this entire site as a single file right now using the save icon in the sidebar!
⁂⁂⁂
title: Introduction/12/code
parent: Introduction/12
type: text/markdown

```markdown
#### Demonstration:
You can save this entire site as a single file right now using the save icon in the sidebar!
